      "subject": "ועז מלך משפט אהב",
      "rationale": "Strong i bilong king (we king i laikim kot), o strongpela king em i narapela tok — 'king bilong strong i laikim kot'? Ol tanim tok i no wankain."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "tsedek",
      "rationale": "צדקה mi holim olsem tsedek — 'stretpela pasin' tasol i lusim nem bilong wanpela tok."
    },
    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "wanem",
      "rationale": "אתה i kamap tupela taim — Hebrew i usim ol pronoun bilong strongim, 'yu wanem' i strongim Tok Pisin."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Na strong bilong king i laikim ⟨את⟩ kot: yu wanem i mekim stret olgeta samting; kot na tsedek long Yakov, yu wanem i wokim.",
